= Robert Biedroń

Biedroń gives the alliance a recognisable progressive brand and a network
outside the old SLD. His interventions open doors that the apparatus cannot,
while raising the price of social conservatism inside the coalition.

- @biedron_tour
- @biedron_equality
- @biedron_mediation
- @poland_hub: Return to the leadership table

@biedron_tour
title: Put the national tour back on the road
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Shared advisor cooldown: 6 months.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Another advisor acted recently, or the tour cannot be funded.
on-arrival: {!
Q.advisor_action_timer = 6;
Q.resources -= 1;
Q.media_capacity += 4;
Q.local_network += 2;
Q.left_poll += 0.2;
if (Q.spring_active) {
    Q.spring_dissent -= 4;
} else {
    Q.progressives_dissent -= 4;
}
Q.news_headline = "Biedroń takes the alliance beyond Warsaw";
!}

The halls are smaller than presidential rallies, but local activists leave
with footage, names and a reason to organise.

- @poland_hub: Return to the leadership table

@biedron_equality
title: Make equality impossible to postpone
subtitle: Shared advisor cooldown: 6 months. Movement trust rises; PSL and the old guard recoil.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: Another advisor intervention is still on cooldown.
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; feminist_trust += 4; progressive_credibility += 4; minority_safety += 2; barons_dissent += 3; psl_relation -= 2; far_right_agenda += 1; news_headline = "Equality returns to the centre of the Left's offer"

Civil partnerships, trans dignity and reproductive freedom are described as
governing commitments, not optional symbols. Allies and opponents both hear
the difference.

- @poland_hub: Return to the leadership table

@biedron_mediation
title: Mediate between Wiosna and the new caucus
subtitle: Shared advisor cooldown: 6 months. Repairs the progressive side of the alliance.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: Another advisor intervention is still on cooldown.
on-arrival: {!
Q.advisor_action_timer = 6;
Q.party_unity += 2;
if (Q.spring_active) {
    Q.spring_dissent -= 5;
    Q.progressives_dissent -= 3;
    Q.news_headline = "Wiosna and the younger caucus divide the work";
} else {
    Q.progressives_dissent -= 6;
    Q.labor_dissent -= 2;
    Q.news_headline =
        "Biedroń mediates between the successor currents of the merged Left";
}
Q.barons_dissent += 1;
!}

The agreement is less a merger than a ceasefire over lists, spokespeople and
movement contacts. For now, that is enough.

- @poland_hub: Return to the leadership table

