@matysiak
title: Paulina Matysiak
subtitle: Rail, smaller cities and a material route beyond Warsaw.
is-pinned-card: true
tags: poland_advisor
view-if: matysiak_advisor = 1
card-image: img/poland/cards/advisor-matysiak.webp
new-page: true

= Paulina Matysiak

Matysiak offers a politics of rail, industry and smaller cities that can cross
the usual cultural blocs. That reach is valuable; cooperation with politicians
outside the democratic opposition can also become an internal crisis of its
own.

- @matysiak_rail
- @matysiak_counties
- @matysiak_caucus
